          "git_sha": "8f5be1f2c06f6d3eb026d77b5e07550767101866",
          "line_end": 239,
          "line_start": 229,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arch1esun/arcgentic",
          "url": "https://github.com/Arch1eSUN/Arcgentic/blob/645c345077d78a6525055f641eb677c361ae767a/README.md#L229-L239"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2ddfa3e7522dd6181e3e6da7acfb7a36e16ac3cbef7107334accc5801e05465f"
      ],
      "text": "The V2 workflow sequence is: idea, brainstorm/planning, round handoff, development, developer self-audit, optional user-test, external audit, pass-or-fix, then next round, next phase, or closeout."
    },
