        "slc_8e8551350e191a1b743ba09381ccd47dd5886a7420314def50f6074b3dedb0ac"
      ],
      "text": "Five fixed roles are defined: Orchestrator (routing/dispatch), Planner (planning and closeout decisions), Developer (building, fixes, self-audit), Test (realistic user testing when needed), and Auditor (independent PASS/NEEDS_FIX/AUDIT_INCOMPLETE review)."
    },
    {
