        "slc_7960f514c3a03e84b77a858d085777b350c257f108b7066a39db158b5fd70170"
      ],
      "text": "Two project-level modes are offered: single-session with named role agents inside the Orchestrator session (faster, weaker audit isolation) and multi-session with fixed project threads (slower, stronger audit discipline); the choice is made once per project."
